net: qdisc_pkt_len_segs_init() cleanup

jira KERNEL-1574
cve CVE-2026-53091
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.162.1.el8_10
commit-author Eric Dumazet <edumazet@google.com>
commit 30e02ec3b4b6bd429a4824f125eb843a291dcccf
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-4.18.0-553.162.1.el8_10/30e02ec3.failed

Reduce indentation level by returning early if the transport header
was not set.

Add an unlikely() clause as this is not the common case.

No functional change.

